Z||000003||Oreif||09-20-2000||01:45 PM||||Actually it only cost him about $900. I think somebody has had problems with Crutchfield. I have bought stuff from them and have had no problems. I just wait for what I want to go on sale then use the 10% discount I get and I pay less than anywhere else.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>The new system I bought and am in the process of installing only cost me $550. I already have the stereo. I just bought speakers and amps.<BR>By the way the system shown looks nice but not enough power. I'll be running 200W to the sub (Rockford) and 220W to the other speakers {Polk and Infinity)<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 09-20-2000).]||||reg||1
